# Uldaros Theorix and a split card (CR 709.3, 709.3a, 709.3b): the copy of Life // Death is cast as one half and only that half's
# mana value counts towards the six. Bot1 exiles Life // Death (3 as the two halves together in exile) and The Theorist, Jace
# Beleren (4) and casts the Death copy (2) and then Jace (4): 6 in all. Counted as the whole card, 3 + 4 = 7, Jace would be over
# the six and not offered. Death returns the Ornithopter card from the graveyard, left untargeted by Uldaros for it.

